OL,3,GNEWSACharity shop helps to 'bankroll'
OL,4,Avillage carnival
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people took part in Pewsey
OL,7,FCarnival on 19 September on dozens of
OL,8,Fhand-decorated carts.
